description: Guardrails for external documentation usage and synchronization
globs:
  - "**/*"
alwaysApply: true
---

# External docs governance

- Use external documentation to confirm behavior, not to paste large excerpts into plans, commits, or chat output.
- Prefer source-of-truth URLs and extract only the minimum actionable facts needed for the current task.
- Record any external-doc assumptions or unknowns explicitly in `docs/external/*` notes before implementation.
- If docs conflict with code/runtime evidence, treat code/runtime as authoritative and mark the doc mismatch for follow-up.
